From db56ea997e05ed94231f1ee3f58834e75015f3be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:52:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Block new USB devices while the screen is locked with
 USBGuard

When USBGuard is running, anything plugged in while the screen is locked
is accepted, so locking doesn't protect against malicious USB devices.
New devices are now blocked until unlock, with a setting and a notice.

BUG: 454479
